# Line endings. Every text file is LF in the index and in the working tree on
# every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says: tests compare golden files and
# file hashes byte for byte, and shell scripts fail on CRLF. This matches
# .editorconfig (end_of_line = lf). Without this file a checkout on Windows
# with core.autocrlf=true has CRLF and 11 tests of lcart fail.
#
# `text=auto` leaves files that Git detects as binary alone. The libmodbus
# submodule (targets/) keeps its own attributes.
* text=auto eol=lf
